1
00:02:30,944 --> 00:02:38,924
After sharing her tragic tale of slavery at the hands of the world nobles,

2
00:02:39,324 --> 00:02:42,124
when Hancock hears of Luffy's own struggle against them,

3
00:02:42,484 --> 00:02:44,424
she offers to take him to Sabaody.

4
00:02:48,604 --> 00:02:52,644
Saving Ace, the next stop, the Great Prison.

5
00:02:55,204 --> 00:02:58,324
You mean it? You're really going to give me a lift?

6
00:02:58,924 --> 00:03:00,364
We aren't enemies anymore.

7
00:03:00,944 --> 00:03:03,264
And I wouldn't lie. I'd be happy to help.

8
00:03:03,844 --> 00:03:05,064
Aw, you're the best!

9
00:03:05,464 --> 00:03:07,804
Well, it can be any kind of boat as long as it floats.

10
00:03:07,884 --> 00:03:09,624
We will set sail tomorrow morning.

11
00:03:09,964 --> 00:03:13,364
The Kuja pirates will get you safely to the Sabaody Archipelago.

12
00:03:14,184 --> 00:03:15,544
With our ship?

13
00:03:15,844 --> 00:03:16,844
Hope it's no trouble.

14
00:03:17,544 --> 00:03:20,704
Rest well tonight, as I'm sure this visit has proved taxing.

15
00:03:23,564 --> 00:03:25,684
I'll be out of here tomorrow morning.

16
00:03:27,604 --> 00:03:29,684
Soon we're all going to be back together.

17
00:03:30,944 --> 00:03:40,144
Goodness, we know what's on his mind.

18
00:03:42,464 --> 00:03:47,824
Sonia, Mary, make arrangements for Luffy to join us as a special guest at the banquet tonight.

19
00:03:48,324 --> 00:03:49,484
Are you sure?

20
00:03:49,724 --> 00:03:51,324
A man attending our banquet?

21
00:03:51,464 --> 00:03:52,664
Do I make myself clear?

22
00:03:53,524 --> 00:03:54,104
Yes.

23
00:03:54,104 --> 00:03:55,884
What kind of banquet?

24
00:03:56,224 --> 00:04:02,544
It's to celebrate the Kuja pirates' safe return and to show appreciation and honor their successful haul.

25
00:04:03,064 --> 00:04:05,184
So the kind with tons of food to eat, right?

26
00:04:06,524 --> 00:04:07,844
Those are my favorite!

27
00:04:08,644 --> 00:04:09,564
All right!

28
00:04:10,144 --> 00:04:10,664
Banquet!

29
00:04:11,424 --> 00:04:12,604
Are you going to come too?

30
00:04:12,604 --> 00:04:15,564
No, I'm feeling a bit tired this evening.

31
00:04:15,904 --> 00:04:17,924
I think I'll be going to bed early.

32
00:04:18,704 --> 00:04:19,704
Oh, well, okay.

33
00:04:20,184 --> 00:04:22,104
Thanks again for the ride and the food.

34
00:04:22,264 --> 00:04:23,704
I can't hardly believe it!

35
00:04:23,704 --> 00:04:33,124
You mean can hardly believe it.

36
00:04:38,044 --> 00:04:39,204
Banquet time!

37
00:04:39,324 --> 00:04:40,224
Banquet time!

38
00:04:40,344 --> 00:04:41,264
Banquet time!

39
00:04:41,364 --> 00:04:44,824
I'm surprised the steak princess has put so much trust in him.

40
00:04:45,044 --> 00:04:46,524
And so quickly, too.

41
00:04:46,524 --> 00:04:49,904
I think that I like you.

42
00:05:01,204 --> 00:05:02,724
It's dinner time!

43
00:05:02,844 --> 00:05:04,224
Bring on the food!

44
00:05:04,884 --> 00:05:05,464
Banquet!

45
00:05:11,864 --> 00:05:14,404
Man, you guys really got to try this stuff.

46
00:05:14,484 --> 00:05:15,424
You're missing out.

47
00:05:16,524 --> 00:05:26,024
Well, if you don't want it, I'll eat it.

48
00:05:32,024 --> 00:05:35,064
It's hard to believe that he's the same man that saved our lives.

49
00:05:35,304 --> 00:05:36,884
I hear he's leaving in the morning.

50
00:05:42,204 --> 00:05:44,444
Men's bodies are as strange as the rumors said.

51
00:05:44,724 --> 00:05:46,184
Did you see him stretch?

52
00:05:46,184 --> 00:05:47,904
Yeah, I saw it in the arena.

53
00:05:48,244 --> 00:05:50,264
They can stretch themselves quite a long way.

54
00:05:50,564 --> 00:05:53,064
I'd really like to get my hands on him and have some fun.

55
00:05:53,244 --> 00:05:55,984
Do you think Luffy would mind if I pulled on his face a bit?

56
00:05:56,524 --> 00:05:57,584
Did you say Luffy?

57
00:05:58,204 --> 00:06:00,344
Yes, that's what the man's name is.

58
00:06:00,604 --> 00:06:01,044
Yeah.

59
00:06:01,264 --> 00:06:01,904
Hey, Luffy!

60
00:06:04,464 --> 00:06:05,844
You watch your mouth.

61
00:06:06,104 --> 00:06:08,644
It's unthinkable to address a man in such a way.

62
00:06:08,764 --> 00:06:11,924
You seem to be forgetting the rules of Amazon Lily.

63
00:06:12,464 --> 00:06:12,824
Fine.

64
00:06:13,004 --> 00:06:14,564
Then why is Luffy at our banquet?

65
00:06:15,764 --> 00:06:16,204
Huh?

66
00:06:16,304 --> 00:06:16,384
Huh?

67
00:06:19,764 --> 00:06:20,564
Good point.

68
00:06:20,764 --> 00:06:23,644
Why is a man who recently had the death sentence attending our banquet?

69
00:06:23,924 --> 00:06:24,184
Ron?

70
00:06:24,424 --> 00:06:26,104
Here, during our celebration.

71
00:06:26,644 --> 00:06:29,724
I find it hard to believe that the snake princess suddenly forgave him.

72
00:06:29,724 --> 00:06:31,864
Or maybe she didn't.

73
00:06:31,904 --> 00:06:32,204
Huh?

74
00:06:32,964 --> 00:06:36,064
Maybe this is a trap she laid out to trick him.

75
00:06:36,444 --> 00:06:36,964
A trap?

76
00:06:37,504 --> 00:06:39,604
She knows he's strong, so she can't take him lightly.

77
00:06:40,084 --> 00:06:43,384
That's why she's stuffing him with food to slow him down and make him drop his guard.

78
00:06:43,964 --> 00:06:46,924
Then, when he least expects it, we all attack it once and give him hell.

79
00:06:47,184 --> 00:06:49,564
That's assuming a lot, but it sounds like fun.

80
00:06:49,564 --> 00:07:03,504
Moving in.

81
00:07:03,604 --> 00:07:04,284
Is everyone ready?

82
00:07:05,584 --> 00:07:07,324
This will be his last meal.

83
00:07:10,384 --> 00:07:10,864
Wait.

84
00:07:11,644 --> 00:07:12,964
He's acting strangely.

85
00:07:12,964 --> 00:07:18,744
No, he saw us.

86
00:07:18,784 --> 00:07:20,384
You're all pissing me off!

87
00:07:24,484 --> 00:07:26,184
I've had enough of this!

88
00:07:28,204 --> 00:07:29,544
He must have figured it out.

89
00:07:29,624 --> 00:07:30,384
We were too slow.

90
00:07:30,664 --> 00:07:32,064
But it doesn't look like he'll surrender.

91
00:07:32,224 --> 00:07:35,164
He'd rather fight us to the death with that pan and ladle than step down.

92
00:07:35,644 --> 00:07:37,824
Just the type of thing we should expect from a man.

93
00:07:38,084 --> 00:07:38,424
